<title>UK: DSl sets 10 bln pesata April 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>DSl sets 10 bln pesata April 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Argentaria Banco de Negocios.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTCSHE-SIEDLUNGS UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON    *5.3836    MATURITY    02.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    02.SEP.97</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (K) 100	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*COUPONS ARE PAYED QUARTERLY STARTING FROM</p>
<p>02.JAN.98.</p>
